{"2074760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Star Boss", "steam_appid": 2074760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Star Boss is a simulation game where you can manage space base.<br>You can make robots and spaceships,explore the space and fight with aliens.<br><br><strong>Backgound Story</strong><br>In 2400, Earth civilization's started interplanetary exploration, building Star Union.<br>With exploration further, Star Union finds alien civilization too powerful.<br>To accelerate civilization development, Star Union determines to begin &quot;Star Boss&quot; project.<br><br><strong>Making Robots and Vehicles</strong><br>You can recruit team members, creat robots and make spaceships.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074760/extras/ab93158da9372eec34048de9ad3cfba9.avif?t=1662018866\" width=750 height=500 /></span><br><br><strong>Exploring Space</strong><br>Your team can be arranged to explore space, collect resourses and defeat monsters.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074760/extras/49977090d5feb0e0fef19d8871a1f403.avif?t=1662018866\" width=480 height=450 /></span><br><br><strong>Defending Alien Creatures</strong><br>Occasionally alien creatures will invade your base, which you need dispatch your team to defend.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074760/extras/3dd2df72edcd3af5fd2d7f2ae2167083.avif?t=1662018866\" width=500 height=688 /></span><br><br><strong>Command System</strong><br>You can enter commands to manage everything of your base, and you can even write javascript code.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074760/extras/a6d1f142ee118e30625dfe01d4338c6d.av